WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.600
Before your first post,

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.420
connect the Facebook profile you

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.500
use for Marketplace.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.110
Start in AutoLander, move

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.550
to Configuration in the left

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.950
sidebar, and click it.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.840
Then select the Facebook tab.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.190
If this is

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.210
your first connection,

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.490
choose Connect Facebook.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.180
Follow the sign-in

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.500
steps with your own personal

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.560
Marketplace profile,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.660
not a dealership Business Page.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.200
Enter your password

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.140
and any security code privately.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.480
If Facebook says that profile

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.920
cannot use Marketplace,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.660
resolve that access issue

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.220
with Facebook before trying

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.560
to post through AutoLander.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.110
When you return to AutoLander,

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.430
check the connection status.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.610
After setup, the Facebook

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.110
Connected indicator at the top

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.450
right is a quick place

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.810
to check before you work.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:44.990
It tells you

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:46.010
about the connection,

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.190
not whether a particular

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.810
vehicle has finished posting.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.150
If the session expires later,

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.570
return to Configuration,

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.010
open Facebook,

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.010
and choose Reconnect Facebook.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.140
Finish the sign-in steps,

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.840
then check the status again.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.540
There's no need to disconnect

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:02.820
a working account just

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.920
to follow this lesson.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.240
For practice,

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.460
locate the Facebook

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.900
tab and the top-right

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.920
connection indicator.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.230
If the connection

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.780
still won't complete, show

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.020
the message to your manager

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.040
on a dealer account,

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.730
or contact the AutoLander

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:16.870
admin through Support

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:18.210
on an individual account.
